@startuml load_and_bind
title Package load and wire descriptor binding
actor Application as app
participant PluginManager as pm
participant "Storage adapter" as storage
participant "ELF loader" as elf

app -> pm : load_available(index, config)
pm -> storage : reread recorded byte count
storage --> pm : package bytes
pm -> pm : parse, CRC, application and declared-limit checks
pm -> app : allocate buffers, unless fixed buffers supplied
app --> pm : image regions
pm -> elf : validate, copy, clear BSS and relocate
elf --> pm : image and descriptor offset
pm -> pm : decode wire descriptor
pm -> app : adapt target entry addresses
app --> pm : native runtime descriptor
pm -> pm : cross-check identity and required services
pm -> pm : validate exact interface and register
pm --> app : plugin ID
@enduml
